    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      298.97,
      401.86,
      322.31
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Institute of PolicyStudies of Sri Lanka (Amendment) Act, No. of 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      334.97,
      401.88,
      382.31
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 7 of the Institute of Policy Studies ofSri Lanka Act, No. 53 of 1988 is hereby amended by therepeal of paragraph (c) of that section, and the substitutiontherefor of the following paragraph:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.85,
      394.97,
      401.85,
      418.31
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(c)the Governor of the Central Bank of Sri Lanka or anofficer nominated by the Governor;\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      430.97,
      401.9,
      454.31
    ],
    "text": "3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
